       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MUTTGT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-I PIC 9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 4
               ADD 2 TO WS-TOTAL
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
